Control of mdl409-non-ascii-value-c-locale: outputdir is a FILENAME option,
which GOption passes through without charset conversion on Unix. In the same
C locale, a non-ASCII directory works: no conversion error, and the dump is
written into /work/café.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint:
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect stderr-lacks: Invalid byte sequence
expect connected: true
expect dump-dir: café
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
outputdir=/work/café
